---
description: Keep diffs minimal and reviewable; avoid drive-by refactors and file-wide rewrites unless explicitly requested.
alwaysApply: false
---

# Small, focused diffs

- Change the minimum necessary to solve the task.
- No unrelated refactors, renames, or formatting sweeps in the same diff.
- Read two similar existing files before adding a new module; match structure and naming.
- Reference canonical files with `@path` instead of re-describing patterns in prose.
